cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
# The title is the working name of the project; it changes with the project rename.
title: "biowarden"
version: 0.0.1
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: "Ha"
    given-names: "Lin"
abstract: >-
  Catch silent errors in bioinformatics tool calls before they run, and measure how often LLM agents
  make them. The project has a checking layer of 108 rules that blocks such a call and prints a
  fix, and a benchmark of 105 clean/faulted task families that was used in two pre-registered
  studies.
keywords:
  - bioinformatics
  - LLM agents
  - silent errors
  - tool calls
  - benchmark
  - rule engine
  - Model Context Protocol
